  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalation of kinetic operations generates higher demand for real‑time ISR, imagery analytics, battlefield AI and communications processing, raising short‑term demand for cloud and specialized compute resources.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
