  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A shortfall in Russian diesel exports forces European and other buyers to source refined products from the Middle East, increasing seaborne flows of oil and refined products transiting Gulf routes and chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_standoff</data>
