  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater government–private operational coordination during the conflict channels rapid procurement, grants and co‑funding to AI firms (for ISR, cybersecurity and logistics), directly increasing the pace of capital deployment into AI projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
