  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased operational coordination and information sharing between governments and private tech companies supplies regulators with transaction-level data and operational support, enabling faster, more targeted implementation and on-the-ground enforcement of tech security and export policies affecting China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
