  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher levels of shipping disruption (delays, reroutings, insurance-driven cutbacks) reduce seaborne deliveries of diesel and middle distillates into European terminals that supply Ukraine, worsening the diesel supply balance available to Ukrainian forces and civilian markets.</data>
