<edge source="ai_economic_power_shift::capital_availability" target="eu_cohesion_crisis::fiscal_space" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An expansion in available investable capital raises private demand for sovereign debt and enables more public‑private financing options, lowering effective sovereign funding costs and thereby widening governments' near‑term fiscal space.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_economic_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">eu_cohesion_crisis</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_economic_power_shift::capital_availability" target="iran_gulf_standoff::shipping_disruption" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater investable capital enables rapid scaling of private AI‑driven convoy protection, autonomous escort services and hardened logistics solutions that reduce rerouting, delays and cargo backlogs during Gulf tensions.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_economic_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_standoff</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_economic_power_shift::capital_availability" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::cross_border_flows" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in available investable capital (sovereign, corporate and private) directly funds more outbound M&amp;A, VC and portfolio allocation into foreign AI assets, raising gross and net cross‑border investment flows tied to the tech rivalry.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_economic_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
