  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in cost of capital raises financing costs for Gulf states and commercial actors, delaying or cancelling procurement of AI‑enabled naval defenses and autonomous escorts and reducing deterrence, which makes maritime attacks more likely.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_economic_power_shift</data>
