  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in prevailing EU policy rates raises bank lending rates and investors' required returns, directly lifting the effective cost of debt and equity that AI firms face when raising finance.</data>
