  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in EU capital‑flow volatility force deal financing interruptions and risk‑off reallocations, directly reducing outbound and inbound cross‑border M&amp;A and portfolio flows tied to US–China tech exposures.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">eu_cohesion_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
